#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!curses.ascii` --- Utilities for ASCII characters"
msgstr ":mod:`!curses.ascii` --- Verktyg för ASCII-tecken"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:7
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/curses/ascii.py`"
msgstr "**Källkod:** :source:`Lib/curses/ascii.py`"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:11
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!curses.ascii` module supplies name constants for ASCII characters "
"and functions to test membership in various ASCII character classes.  The "
"constants supplied are names for control characters as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:16
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Namn"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:16
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Betydelse"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:20
msgid "Start of heading, console interrupt"
msgstr "Start av rubrik, konsolavbrott"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:22
msgid "Start of text"
msgstr "Början av texten"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:24
msgid "End of text"
msgstr "Slut på texten"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:26
msgid "End of transmission"
msgstr "Slut på överföring"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:28
msgid "Enquiry, goes with :const:`ACK` flow control"
msgstr "Förfrågan, går med :const:`ACK` flödeskontroll"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:30
msgid "Acknowledgement"
msgstr "Bekräftelse"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:32
msgid "Bell"
msgstr "Klocka"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:34
msgid "Backspace"
msgstr "Backsteg"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:36
msgid "Tab"
msgstr "Flik"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:38
msgid "Alias for :const:`TAB`: \"Horizontal tab\""
msgstr "Alias för :const:`TAB`: \"Horisontell flik\""

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:40
msgid "Line feed"
msgstr "Linjematning"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:42
msgid "Alias for :const:`LF`: \"New line\""
msgstr "Alias för :const:`LF`: \"Ny rad\""

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:44
msgid "Vertical tab"
msgstr "Vertikal flik"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:46
msgid "Form feed"
msgstr "Form matning"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:48
msgid "Carriage return"
msgstr "Vagnsretur"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:50
msgid "Shift-out, begin alternate character set"
msgstr "Shift-out, börja med alternativ teckenuppsättning"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:52
msgid "Shift-in, resume default character set"
msgstr "Skifta in, återgå till standardteckenset"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:54
msgid "Data-link escape"
msgstr "Data-link escape"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:56
msgid "XON, for flow control"
msgstr "XON, för flödeskontroll"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:58
msgid "Device control 2, block-mode flow control"
msgstr "Device control 2, block-mode flödeskontroll"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:60
msgid "XOFF, for flow control"
msgstr "XOFF, för flödeskontroll"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:62
msgid "Device control 4"
msgstr "Enhetskontroll 4"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:64
msgid "Negative acknowledgement"
msgstr "Negativ bekräftelse"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:66
msgid "Synchronous idle"
msgstr "Synkron tomgång"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:68
msgid "End transmission block"
msgstr "Sluta överföringsblock"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:70
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Avbryt"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:72
msgid "End of medium"
msgstr "Slut på medium"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:74
msgid "Substitute"
msgstr "Vikarie"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:76
msgid "Escape"
msgstr "Flykt"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:78
msgid "File separator"
msgstr "Filseparator"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:80
msgid "Group separator"
msgstr "Gruppseparator"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:82
msgid "Record separator, block-mode terminator"
msgstr "Recordavskiljare, block-mode terminator"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:84
msgid "Unit separator"
msgstr "Enhet separator"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:86
msgid "Space"
msgstr "Utrymme"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:88
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Ta bort"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:91
msgid ""
"Note that many of these have little practical significance in modern usage.  "
"The mnemonics derive from teleprinter conventions that predate digital "
"computers."
msgstr ""
"Observera att många av dessa har liten praktisk betydelse i modern "
"användning.  De mnemotekniska begreppen härrör från konventioner för "
"teleprinters som fanns före digitala datorer."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:94
msgid ""
"The module supplies the following functions, patterned on those in the "
"standard C library:"
msgstr ""
"Modulen innehåller följande funktioner, som är utformade efter dem i "
"standardbiblioteket i C:"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:100
msgid ""
"Checks for an ASCII alphanumeric character; it is equivalent to ``isalpha(c) "
"or isdigit(c)``."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerar om det är ett alfanumeriskt ASCII-tecken; det motsvarar "
"``isalpha(c) or isdigit(c)``."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:106
msgid ""
"Checks for an ASCII alphabetic character; it is equivalent to ``isupper(c) "
"or islower(c)``."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerar om det finns ett alfabetiskt ASCII-tecken; motsvarar "
"``isupper(c) or islower(c)``."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:112
msgid "Checks for a character value that fits in the 7-bit ASCII set."
msgstr ""
"Söker efter ett teckenvärde som passar in i 7-bitars ASCII-uppsättningen."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:117
msgid "Checks for an ASCII blank character; space or horizontal tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:122
msgid ""
"Checks for an ASCII control character (in the range 0x00 to 0x1f or 0x7f)."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerar om det finns ett ASCII-kontrolltecken (i intervallet 0x00 till "
"0x1f eller 0x7f)."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:127
msgid ""
"Checks for an ASCII decimal digit, ``'0'`` through ``'9'``.  This is "
"equivalent to ``c in string.digits``."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerar om det finns en ASCII-decimalsiffra, ``'0'`` till ``'9'``.  "
"Detta är likvärdigt med ``c in string.digits``."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:133
msgid "Checks for any ASCII printable character except space."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:138
msgid "Checks for an ASCII lower-case character."
msgstr "Kontrollerar om det är ett ASCII-tecken med små bokstäver."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:143
msgid "Checks for any ASCII printable character including space."
msgstr "Kontrollerar alla ASCII-utskrivbara tecken inklusive mellanslag."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:148
msgid ""
"Checks for any ASCII printable character which is not a space or an "
"alphanumeric character."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:154
msgid ""
"Checks for ASCII white-space characters; space, line feed, carriage return, "
"form feed, horizontal tab, vertical tab."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerar ASCII-tecknen för vita mellanrum: mellanslag, radmatning, "
"vagnsretur, formmatning, horisontell tabb, vertikal tabb."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:160
msgid "Checks for an ASCII uppercase letter."
msgstr "Kontrollerar om det är en ASCII-versal bokstav."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:165
msgid ""
"Checks for an ASCII hexadecimal digit.  This is equivalent to ``c in string."
"hexdigits``."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerar om det finns en ASCII hexadecimal siffra.  Detta är likvärdigt "
"med ``c i string.hexdigits``."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:171
msgid ""
"Checks for an ASCII control character (ordinal values 0 to 31).  Unlike :"
"func:`iscntrl`, this does not include the delete character (0x7f)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:177
msgid "Checks for a non-ASCII character (ordinal values 0x80 and above)."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollerar om det finns ett icke-ASCII-tecken (ordinalvärden 0x80 och "
"högre)."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:179
msgid ""
"These functions accept either integers or single-character strings; when the "
"argument is a string, it is first converted using the built-in function :"
"func:`ord`."
msgstr ""
"Dessa funktioner accepterar antingen heltal eller strängar med enstaka "
"tecken; när argumentet är en sträng konverteras det först med den inbyggda "
"funktionen :func:`ord`."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:182
msgid ""
"Note that all these functions check ordinal bit values derived from the "
"character of the string you pass in; they do not actually know anything "
"about the host machine's character encoding."
msgstr ""
"Observera att alla dessa funktioner kontrollerar ordinala bitvärden som "
"härrör från tecknet i den sträng du skickar in; de vet faktiskt ingenting om "
"värdmaskinens teckenkodning."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:186
msgid ""
"The following two functions take either a single-character string or integer "
"byte value; they return a value of the same type."
msgstr ""
"Följande två funktioner tar antingen en enteckenssträng eller ett "
"heltalsbytevärde; de returnerar ett värde av samma typ."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:192
msgid "Return the ASCII value corresponding to the low 7 bits of *c*."
msgstr "Returnera ASCII-värdet som motsvarar de 7 lägsta bitarna i *c*."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:197
msgid ""
"Return the control character corresponding to the given character (the "
"character bit value is bitwise-anded with 0x1f)."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar kontrolltecknet som motsvarar det angivna tecknet (tecknets "
"bitvärde är bitvis-anded med 0x1f)."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:203
msgid ""
"Return the 8-bit character corresponding to the given ASCII character (the "
"character bit value is bitwise-ored with 0x80)."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar det 8-bitars tecken som motsvarar det angivna ASCII-tecknet "
"(teckenets bitvärde är bitvisoredigerat med 0x80)."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:206
msgid ""
"The following function takes either a single-character string or integer "
"value; it returns a string."
msgstr ""
"Följande funktion tar antingen en enteckenssträng eller ett heltalsvärde; "
"den returnerar en sträng."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:216
msgid ""
"Return a string representation of the ASCII character *c*.  If *c* is "
"printable, this string is the character itself.  If the character is a "
"control character (0x00--0x1f) the string consists of a caret (``'^'``) "
"followed by the corresponding uppercase letter. If the character is an ASCII "
"delete (0x7f) the string is ``'^?'``.  If the character has its meta bit "
"(0x80) set, the meta bit is stripped, the preceding rules applied, and "
"``'!'`` prepended to the result."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar en strängrepresentation av ASCII-tecknet *c*.  Om *c* är ett "
"skrivbart tecken är denna sträng själva tecknet.  Om tecknet är ett "
"kontrolltecken (0x00--0x1f) består strängen av en caret (``'^'``) följt av "
"motsvarande versal bokstav. Om tecknet är en ASCII delete (0x7f) är strängen "
"``'^?'``.  Om tecknet har sin metabit (0x80) inställd, tas metabiten bort, "
"föregående regler tillämpas och ``'!'`` läggs till resultatet."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:226
msgid ""
"A 33-element string array that contains the ASCII mnemonics for the thirty-"
"two ASCII control characters from 0 (NUL) to 0x1f (US), in order, plus the "
"mnemonic ``SP`` for the space character."
msgstr ""
"En strängmatris med 33 element som innehåller ASCII-mnemonikerna för de "
"trettiotvå ASCII-kontrolltecknen från 0 (NUL) till 0x1f (US), i ordning, "
"plus mnemoniken ``SP`` för mellanslagstecknet."

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:210
msgid "^ (caret)"
msgstr "^ (caret)"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:210
msgid "in curses module"
msgstr "i curses-modulen"

#: ../../library/curses.ascii.rst:210
msgid "! (exclamation)"
msgstr "! (utrop)"
